    "detailed_description": "Continue the action &amp; adventure, in sequel were left off in the snow cave trap inside of magical chest. Now finding a way out of chest dimension universe, that you got trap in. Solve the mystery with Pirate Parrot behind the mystical chest dimension changing into all kinds of spirit animals beyond controlling Dark Wolf?!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* Over 100 levels in Action-Adventure in sequel of continuation campaign story. Prequel. (WWTH) Shock Supported Gamepad / PC / STEAMDECK<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* Beat\u2019em up your enemies with melee attacks or pickup items to destroy enemies, fire items at enemies to damage them.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* Over 25 playable characters plus vehicles mine cart, go kart, magic carpet, pirate ship and yellow submarine travel though Magic Color realms.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* Movie cinematics of level gameplay plus boss death battle finish cinematic though Magic Color Realms. <br />\r\n<br />\r\n* Unlock the power ups to your spirit animal though the quest seven realms of Magic of the chest you got trapped in from first Encounter prequel.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* Leave where you left off in adventure, from (Lobby level) to save game &amp; load game from save point from the pot item on map to open menu with three game <br />\r\n   slots to save data ABC that load from progress campaign player left off.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* Play in third person view or in first person view game play though adventure different way enjoy game experience.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* Pick up items &amp; collect wolf gold coins, plus pickup items can fly with in the realm maps by jump on them holding item button pickup to fly around explore <br />\r\n   your treasure hunt Quest.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* Find the way out to next color realm level, by collecting shatter crystals pieces of the Magic Color Realm to advance to the next area, Find hunt search?!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* Enemy minions throughout the map plus mini bosses though quest in maps with big bosses battles in each realm, to unlock your power ups again for final boss <br />\r\n   battle. First encounter. <br />\r\n<br />\r\n* Bosses rematch first encounter only pick up destructive items to damage bosses, then rematch melee or pick up items to damage bosses in second encounter from powerups to face final realm boss.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n* Free updates with game with DLC and Multiplayer game when ready to download TBD.",
